<title>USA: Sioux City hogs up $1.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs up $1.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.50</p>
<p>higher in moderate trade. Top $61.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3   220-270 lbs     61.00-61.50</p>
<p>	   270-280 lbs     60.00-61.00</p>
<p>US 2-3   280-300 lbs     58.50-59.50</p>
<p>US 3-4   300-330 lbs     55.00-58.00</p>
<p>Sows: 1.00-2.00 higher. Top 55.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-400 lbs     50.00</p>
<p>	   400-500 lbs     51.00-52.00</p>
<p>	   500-550 lbs     53.50-54.00</p>
<p>	   550-700 lbs     54.50-55.00</p>
</text>
